MAIN
MOVE TEMP 12 4
MOVE TEMP 13 HALLOCATE TEMP 12
MOVE TEMP 5 TEMP 13
MOVE TEMP 14 8
MOVE TEMP 15 HALLOCATE TEMP 14
MOVE TEMP 6 TEMP 15
MOVE TEMP 16 A_iterative
HSTORE TEMP 6 0 TEMP 16
MOVE TEMP 17 A_nonRecursive
HSTORE TEMP 6 4 TEMP 17
MOVE TEMP 18 TEMP 6
HSTORE TEMP 5 0 TEMP 18
MOVE TEMP 4 TEMP 5
HLOAD TEMP 7 TEMP 4 0
HLOAD TEMP 8 TEMP 7 4
MOVE TEMP 19 10
MOVE TEMP 20 CALL TEMP 8 ( TEMP 4 TEMP 19 )
PRINT TEMP 20
END
A_nonRecursive [ 2 ]
BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 21 0
MOVE TEMP 22 NE TEMP 1 TEMP 21
CJUMP TEMP 22 L0
MOVE TEMP 23 1
MOVE TEMP 24 MINUS TEMP 1 TEMP 23
MOVE TEMP 1 TEMP 24
L0  NOOP
MOVE TEMP 9 TEMP 0
HLOAD TEMP 10 TEMP 9 0
HLOAD TEMP 11 TEMP 10 0
MOVE TEMP 25 1
MOVE TEMP 26 MINUS TEMP 1 TEMP 25
MOVE TEMP 27 CALL TEMP 11 ( TEMP 9 TEMP 26 )

RETURN TEMP 27
END
A_iterative [ 2 ]
BEGIN
MOVE TEMP 28 9
MOVE TEMP 2 TEMP 28
MOVE TEMP 29 0
MOVE TEMP 3 TEMP 29
L1 MOVE TEMP 30 0
MOVE TEMP 31 NE TEMP 2 TEMP 30
CJUMP TEMP 31 L2
MOVE TEMP 32 1
MOVE TEMP 33 MINUS TEMP 2 TEMP 32
MOVE TEMP 2 TEMP 33
MOVE TEMP 34 PLUS TEMP 3 TEMP 1
MOVE TEMP 3 TEMP 34
MOVE TEMP 35 1
MOVE TEMP 36 MINUS TEMP 1 TEMP 35
MOVE TEMP 1 TEMP 36
JUMP L1
L2  NOOP

RETURN TEMP 3
END

